{% doc %}
  SYPB gate.

  Any [data-sypb-trigger] element opens this instead of jumping straight to
  the video. It asks for a first name and an email, saves them as a real
  Shopify customer with marketing consent, and only then reveals the video and
  the group link.

  The details land under Customers in the Shopify admin, tagged sypb, so they
  can be filtered, exported to CSV, and emailed with Shopify Email without
  anyone needing another login.

  Shopify's customer form reloads the page on submit, so the modal reopens
  itself on the way back and goes straight to the video. A returning visitor
  skips the form entirely.
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign posted = false
  if form.posted_successfully?
    assign posted = true
  endif

  assign video = settings.sypb_video_embed
  assign fallback_link = settings.sypb_video_url | default: settings.sypb_link

  comment
    A Google Drive video is neither YouTube nor Vimeo, so it cannot go in the
    video setting above. Drive will play inside an iframe, but only from its
    /preview URL: the /view URL people copy out of the address bar renders the
    whole Drive interface and refuses to frame.

    So the share link is converted here. Both shapes Drive hands out are
    covered, the /file/d/ID/view one and the older open?id=ID one.
  endcomment
  assign drive_id = ''
  if settings.sypb_video_url contains 'drive.google.com/file/d/'
    assign drive_id = settings.sypb_video_url | split: '/file/d/' | last | split: '/' | first | split: '?' | first
  elsif settings.sypb_video_url contains 'drive.google.com/open?id='
    assign drive_id = settings.sypb_video_url | split: 'id=' | last | split: '&' | first
  endif
-%}

<div
  id="SypbGate"
  class="sypb-gate"
  role="dialog"
  aria-modal="true"
  aria-labelledby="SypbGateTitle"
  hidden
  {% if posted %}data-autoopen="true"{% endif %}
  data-fallback="{{ fallback_link | escape }}"
>
  <div class="sypb-gate__backdrop" data-sypb-close></div>

  <div class="sypb-gate__panel">
    <button type="button" class="sypb-gate__close" data-sypb-close aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}">
      {% render 'icon', name: 'close' %}
    </button>

    {%- comment -%} Step one: who are you. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="sypb-gate__step" data-sypb-step="form" {% if posted %}hidden{% endif %}>
      <span class="route-label route-label--amber">SYPB</span>
      <h2 id="SypbGateTitle">Watch the video first</h2>
      <p>Tell us where to send it and it plays right here. You'll also get the group link and the odd email when something worth knowing lands. No spam, unsubscribe any time.</p>

      {% form 'customer', id: 'SypbGateForm' %}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="sypb,video-watched">

        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="SypbGateName">First name</label>
          <input class="input" type="text" id="SypbGateName" name="contact[first_name]" autocomplete="given-name" required>
        </div>

        <div class="field {% if form.errors %}has-error{% endif %}">
          <label class="field__label" for="SypbGateEmail">Email</label>
          <input class="input" type="email" id="SypbGateEmail" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required>
          <span class="field__error">{{ 'forms.invalid_email' | t }}</span>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--block">Show me the video</button>

        {% if form.errors %}
          <div class="form-status" data-state="error">{{ 'forms.error_generic' | t }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endform %}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Step two: the video and the way in. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="sypb-gate__step" data-sypb-step="video" {% unless posted %}hidden{% endunless %}>
      <span class="route-label route-label--amber">SYPB</span>
      <h2>Here it is. Watch, then come in.</h2>

      {% if video != blank %}
        <div class="sypb-gate__video">
          <iframe
            src="{% if video.type == 'youtube' %}https://www.youtube.com/embed/{{ video.id }}{% else %}https://player.vimeo.com/video/{{ video.id }}{% endif %}"
            title="Start Your Product Business"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      {% elsif drive_id != blank %}
        <div class="sypb-gate__video">
          <iframe
            src="https://drive.google.com/file/d/{{ drive_id }}/preview"
            title="Start Your Product Business"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="autoplay"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      {% elsif fallback_link != blank %}
        {%- comment -%}
          Only ever rendered with a real link. An anchor with an empty href
          points at the current page, so a blank setting used to send people
          back to the page they were already on, which reads as the video
          being broken.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <p>
          <a href="{{ fallback_link }}" class="btn btn--primary btn--block" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the video</a>
        </p>
      {% else %}
        <p class="sypb-gate__missing">
          The video link has not been set yet. Add it in the theme editor under
          Theme settings, SYPB video link.
        </p>
      {% endif %}

      <p>When you're done, the group is where the questions get answered.</p>

      <a href="{{ settings.sypb_link }}" class="btn btn--primary btn--block" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Join SYPB, it's free
      </a>
      <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="btn btn--ghost btn--block">Or go straight to the stock</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="{{ 'sypb-gate.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% stylesheet %}
  .sypb-gate {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 90;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: var(--space-4);
  }

  .sypb-gate[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .sypb-gate__backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-navy) 78%, transparent);
  }

  .sypb-gate__panel {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 34rem;
    max-height: 90vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 26, 63, 0.35);
  }

  .sypb-gate__close {
    position: absolute;
    top: var(--space-3);
    right: var(--space-3);
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .sypb-gate__close svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .sypb-gate__step .route-label {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .sypb-gate__step h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sypb-gate__step .field {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .sypb-gate__step .btn + .btn {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .sypb-gate__video {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .sypb-gate__missing {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--color-amber-soft);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .sypb-gate__video iframe {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
